	(text "Layout copied from proves_canted_turnstile (OreSat0 heritage). Keep the copper as routed:\n- UHF_B is 94.6 mm longer than UHF_A: lambda_g/4 at 437 MHz on JLC04161H-7628 (e_eff 3.32), 90.4 deg.\n- UHF_0/90/180/270 are length-matched (25.25 mm). AE1..AE4 sit 90 deg apart, in order, around the board.\n- RF netclass: 0.3424 mm CPWG, 0.4 mm gap to the GND pour.\nCheck before fab: QBA-07+ port-10 (90) phase sign from the .s3p (AE1/AE3 must be 180 deg apart)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "690ed572-6994-5d63-9ddc-f4170ffd1a32")
